图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Curated, verified MCP server bundle for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): one install brings demo, memory, filesystem, GitHub, Playwright and remote HTTP MCP servers, with a connectivity verifier and CI checks.","id":"gh:1334464943","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-mcp-bridge","slug":"Edge-Echo/dsh-mcp-bridge","topics":["cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","mcp","mcp-server","model-context-protocol"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Curated, verified MCP server bundle for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): one install brings demo, memory, fil"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"esystem, GitHub, Playwright and remote HTTP MCP servers, with a connectivity verifier and CI checks."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-mcp-bridge"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Install six curated MCP servers into DSH in one command — and find out which of them actually work"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ed MCP servers into DSH in one command — and find out which of them actually work on your machine.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"### When you need this"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- You want your DSH agent to have MCP tools (browser automation, session memory, file access) withou"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"t hand-writing six configs and getting the quoting wrong\n- A server will not start and you cannot te"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ll whether it is the config, the package or your network\n- You want a list that says which servers a"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"re genuinely reachable, rather than another copy of the upstream docs"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Every curated server is started, handshaken and its tool count checked in CI — `everything` answers "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"with 13 tools, `memory` with 9, `filesystem` with 14."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"One install gives your dsh agent a set of MCP servers that are started and queried on every push — n"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ot a raw YAML you have to figure out. Every curated server has a machine-readable definition in `ser"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"vers/`, and `scripts/verify-servers.mjs` checks each one's connectivity, so \"verified\" is a CI-guara"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"nteed claim, not marketing."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Tools appear to the model as `mcp__<serverName>__<toolName>` (same server-qualified shape as Claude "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"Code / Codex). The bridge itself is DSH's built-in `@deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client`: stdio + streamable"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"-http, auto-reconnect, HMR hot-swap."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"> 中文文档见 README.zh.md。"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Feedback"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Installs are visible in the download counts; whether this helps is not. If you use it, one line\nabou"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"t the actual task is worth more than a star — **particularly if it did not work**, which is\nthe case"},{"id":"p11s3","text":" that never gets reported:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- what you were trying to do\n- whether it did it\n- what was missing or wrong"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Tell me in an issue — or if something is already broken,\njust open a normal bug report."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"This package is a **configuration layer**, not a plugin of its own. Its `cordis.patch.yml`\ninserts e"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ntries that point at `@deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client`, which the host provides."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- **`@deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client` must be installed in the profile you are adding this to**,\nat the "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"version matching your DSH line.\n- It is declared as a permissive optional peer (`>=0.1.0-rc.6`) rath"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"er than a dependency.\nPinning it previously forced an old copy into the tree whose own peers\n(`dsh-t"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"ools@^0.0.1-rc.1`) conflict with current DSH releases, which made installation fail\non version resol"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"ution. Reported as issue #2."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"If installation fails, check that the client version in your profile matches your DSH version:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Interactive installer"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"`init` writes real `insert:` entries into the profile's **user patch layer**\n(`$DSH_HOME/profiles/<n"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ame>/cordis.patch.yml`), so your selection survives plugin\nupgrades and coexists with your own patch"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"es. It warns about servers that need\nenvironment variables or a placeholder path to edit."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Why not just configure the MCP servers yourself?"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Because the fiddly parts are not the YAML — they are everything around it."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- The user patch layer **overrides** existing entries; naming a new id there fails with\n`patch: entr"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"y \"x\" not found`. New servers need `insert:`.\n- Config nested one level too shallow parses to `confi"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"g: null`, and the server silently never starts.\n- A server that connects but exposes no tools looks "},{"id":"p24s4","text":"exactly like a working one until you ask the model."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"This bundle ships working shapes, an installer that writes them correctly (`init`), inspectors\n(`lis"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"t`, `validate`) and a verifier that actually connects."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Prereqs: `dsh` and `pnpm` on PATH (`dsh plugin` forwards to pnpm; install with `npm i -g pnpm`)."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The demo server (MCP official `everything`) is enabled by default — no API key, pure local `npx`. Af"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"ter restart, ask your model to \"call the everything server's echo tool with hello\" and it should use"},{"id":"p29s3","text":" `mcp__everything__echo`."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"> First run downloads the server packages via `npx`; subsequent runs are cached."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Curated catalog"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| Server | What it gives you | Config needed | Verified |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| `everything` | Demo tools: echo, add, long-running ops, tiny image | none (default on) | ✅ 13 tool"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"s |\n| `memory` | In-session knowledge graph (entities/relations) | none | ✅ 9 tools |\n| `filesystem`"},{"id":"p33s3","text":" | File read/write/search, **scoped to explicit roots** | root dir (edit args) | ✅ 14 tools (given a"},{"id":"p33s4","text":" real dir) |\n| `github` | Repos / issues / PRs | `GITHUB_TOKEN` | ⏸ needs config |\n| `playwright` | "},{"id":"p33s5","text":"Browser automation (navigate/click/screenshot) | first-run browser download | ⏸ heavy, excluded from"},{"id":"p33s6","text":" CI |\n| `remote-http` | Your own / hosted HTTP MCP server | URL (+ optional token) | ⏸ needs config "},{"id":"p33s7","text":"CI |\n| `remote-http` | Your own / hosted HTTP MCP server | URL (+ optional token) | ⏸ needs config |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"To enable a commented preset, uncomment its block in the profile's `cordis.patch.yml` (hot-reloaded "},{"id":"p34s2","text":"via HMR) or edit `cordis.patch.yml` in this package."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Verify the catalog yourself"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Prints `PASS` / `SKIP` / `FAIL` per server; exits non-zero on any failure. `VERIFY_TIMEOUT_MS=15000`"},{"id":"p37s2","text":" tunes the per-server timeout. Single-server troubleshooting: `node scripts/probe-server.mjs npx -y "},{"id":"p37s3","text":"rver timeout. Single-server troubleshooting: `node scripts/probe-server.mjs npx -y your-mcp-server`."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Adding your own MCP server"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Each server is one `@deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client` entry. Either add it to the profile's user patch la"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"yer (recommended, HMR applies it without restart):"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"…or drop a definition into `servers/` (so `verify` covers it) and add the matching entry to `cordis."},{"id":"p41s2","text":"ition into `servers/` (so `verify` covers it) and add the matching entry to `cordis.patch.yml` here."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"### Config fields (from dsh-mcp-client)"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"| Field | Transports | Required | Meaning |"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"| `transport` | both | yes | `\"stdio\"` or `\"streamable-http\"` |\n| `serverName` | both | yes | tool n"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"amespace, unique among live instances |\n| `command` / `args` / `env` / `cwd` | stdio | command yes |"},{"id":"p44s3","text":" child process spec |\n| `url` / `headers` | http | url yes | endpoint + auth headers |\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
